WEBVTT

00:07:57.954 --> 00:08:00.996
It was approaching 11
when I exited right toward Afula,

00:08:00.996 --> 00:08:04.079
and passed a large quarry
and was soon in Kafr Qara.

00:08:04.496 --> 00:08:06.371
I felt a pang of nerves.

00:08:07.163 --> 00:08:10.829
But Chopin was on the radio,
seven beautiful mazurkas,

00:08:10.829 --> 00:08:13.454
and I pulled into a lot by a gas station

00:08:13.496 --> 00:08:15.329
to listen and to calm.

00:08:16.913 --> 00:08:18.829
I'd been told that in an Arab town,

00:08:18.871 --> 00:08:22.288
one need only mention the name of a local
and it will be recognized.

00:08:23.204 --> 00:08:25.079
And I was mentioning Abed and myself,

00:08:25.079 --> 00:08:27.413
noting deliberately
that I was here in peace,

00:08:27.454 --> 00:08:29.621
to the people in this town,

00:08:29.621 --> 00:08:32.579
when I met Mohamed
outside a post office at noon.